Fresh 20-seed hold-out of thresholded local peak-norm stabilization for 4m+r. Mild saturation is left identical to standard elementwise-clipped 4m+r; only type-pairs with max_update/max(abs(raw update)) below 0.50, 0.33, or 0.25 are additionally damped. Primary question: can severe-peak-only damping retain the scale 0.08-0.10 late recovery while rescuing scale 0.115? Primary contrasts at epoch 200 compare each thresholded rule against standard and local for hard margin, with CE, accuracy, soft margin, weight norm, finite, and local activation diagnostics as secondary outcomes. Fresh seeds 2010-2029, held-out jitter base 103,000,000.
